{"v":4,"catch":"為另一天的假期做好準備！","desc":"《PAC & PAL》是NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.）於1983年發行的動作遊戲。\n翻牌並吃水果和特殊目標以獲得分數。\n吃掉特殊目標以暫時凍結敵人並攻擊他們。\n新角色 MIL 會撿起水果和卡片，觸摸她即可將它們取回。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-09-01","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5e7bbf34101ee4cedaffc132e1b4fa410be42330f478a52d0831250f3e7a23da.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2549dbd266492b0cb2c6543aa2ad89cf756d0d0cfc92633e9056957b48f2e095.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9412b7f9b1aadd1e4d65e7932f994e8d059218a6287d535c390c8b40853fbe4c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ba956f6a301edeafd246df6e6a677ac92ee920f9309424eb8d3761a8906ead9b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/28db3eed48a115e9ba7900c13aeb85f18a831752c33bc69e445fd67cb5d92ba0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/167c8a5ce8e4248948057302459baebbb814ea4fdfda70ab5803846b7ebfb70c.jpg"],"titleId":"01008d8018646000","dlc":[]}